# PostScript: PostScript Language Reference, third edition (Adobe), 3.2 Syntax; requirements/languages/postscript.md
name     postscript ps eps

keyword  def if ifelse for repeat loop exit forall begin end bind exec stop stopped
builtin  dup exch pop copy roll index clear add sub mul div idiv mod neg abs moveto lineto rmoveto
builtin  rlineto curveto closepath newpath stroke fill showpage gsave grestore translate rotate scale
builtin  setrgbcolor setgray setlinewidth findfont scalefont setfont show true false null

ident-part     -
line-comment   %
string   ( )  : escapes multiline
string   <~ ~>  : multiline
sigil    /    : attr
operators  []{}<>
